    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0451","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Saoirse Achterberg talks about the politics of the colour orange. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</Description>
